<title>USA: Micron gets 63 pct of NetFRAME.</title>
<headline>Micron gets 63 pct of NetFRAME.</headline>
<dateline>NAMPA, Idaho 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Electronics Inc said Tuesday about 63 percent of the outstanding shares of NetFRAME Systems Inc were tendered for $1 each in response to Micron's tender offer.</p>
<p>The offer closed July 14.</p>
<p>Micron Electronics said it will proceed with the necessary steps to complete the merger of NetFRAME with Micron's Payette Acquisition Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>NetFRAME Systems Inc makes enterprise-class multiprocessor servers.</p>
</text>
